<title>SINGAPORE: India buys aviation turbine fuel from Vitol, +$1.21.</title>
<headline>India buys aviation turbine fuel from Vitol, +$1.21.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Indian Oil Corp (IOC) bought by tender 25,000 tonnes of aviation turbine fuel from Dutch trader Vitol at around $1.21 per barrel above MidEast quotes for May 11-20 delivery, industry source said on Monday.</p>
<p>The cargo is for delivery to Bombay, on India's west coast, on a cost-and-freight (c-and-f) basis. The tender closed on April 24.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3084)</p>
